# kin/youth/wear/kilt_hang: the pleated kilt to the knee: alternating lit and shadowed pleats, a lit hem; the pleats
# (P2b motion rollout 2026-10-22, KIN-YOUTH) the side `flare` (the run) is a full skirt row trailing a pixel behind the
# walk's `wide` (the old flap at the front cut the thighs into slivers and left the hip row 4 px).

# fan on the side walk and in the run

# KIN-YOUTH (P2b wave 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Keys: rest, wide, flare, kneel, lie.

# Motion fix round 3 (R3-06): the side (R, L) wide and flare keys (the side walk and run) end a row higher than rest, so

# the youth's thighs show under the hem (the tunic a lone hem row); the hang moves with the body on the down frames.
use person
body youth
role garment kilt
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
sway 1

view D key rest origin 6 0
|.5878787665.
|.5878787665.
|.5989898765.

